<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1362] Update notifier causes Ignite instance leak.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1362</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;IgniteKernal has private non-static anonymous class for GridTimerTask which forces update notify. &lt;br/&gt;
As a result IgniteKernal instance leaks to it and stays in memory for a long time even after node is stopped.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12861485">IGNITE-1362</key>
            <summary>Update notifier causes Ignite instance leak.</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
